# One cluster of radius zero in a world with no height, and nobody ever moves
# off it: z has no extent (axis_scale 0, every z step 0, wrap returns the
# -0.0 floor), every entity has the same Morton code, so all three radix
# passes are skipped and the keys stay in id order, every leaf box is one
# point, every k-nearest answer is decided by id alone and radius-zero
# queries at the centre accept everything. Over a thousand entities, so the
# tree has four levels of point boxes.
id: xb3_flat_coincident
visibility: public
track: spatial
